   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Eyes Like The Sky**: back after 81 archived shows (1663 days); rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n- **Year Of Our Lord**: back after 81 archived shows (1663 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [6]\n- **The Raid**: back after 81 archived shows (1663 days); rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n- **Evil Man**: back after 118 archived shows (3507 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [6]\n- **Down The Sink**: rare: 10 archived performances [6]\n- **Astroturf**: rare: 5 archived performances [6]\n- **<chatting**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **<chatting 2**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2023-06-21.MC59W** (recommended): source not stated; 27 songs; 182 min; rated 3.33/5 by 3 [1]\n- **kglw2023-06-21.4chmix**: source not stated; 27 songs; 181 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Band paid tribute to Broderick Smith, Ambrose's father, during the performance [3]\n- Approximately 18,000 people attended the concert at the Hollywood Bowl [3]\n- Stu Mackenzie played vocals, guitars, keyboards, flute, and piano [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2023-06-21.MC59W**: taped by captainentropy; transferred by captainentropy; source: Nevaton MC59/W > MixPre 3 II (32/96) (section N1, center, clamped to rail, DIN) [1]\n- **kglw2023-06-21.4chmix**: taped by captainentropy; transferred by captainentropy; source: Source1: Nevaton MC59/W > MixPre 3 II (32/96) (section N1, center, clamped to rail, DIN). Source2: Neumann AK 50 > nBob actives > Naiant PFA > Zoom F3 (32/96)… [2]\n- kglw2023-06-21.MC59W: King Gizzard authorized the recording for sharing on the Live Music Archive [1][4]\n- kglw2023-06-21.MC59W: The set was a three-hour marathon with no intermission [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Conny Chavez: [King Gizzard & The Lizard Wizard Three Hour Show At The Hollywood Bowl On June 21, 2023 -](https://music.mxdwn.com/2022/11/24/los-angeles/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-three-hour-show-at-the-hollywood-bowl-on-june-21-2023/) [7]",
